ться за звание следующей большой музыкальной звезды, гастролируя с хедлайнером суперзвездой.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"217485","ru":"Sirius","en":"Sirius","year":"2023","type":"Аниме","rating":10.0,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/49Mf08kjjxa9wpPKVuVSIfk43az.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dmUbpRxFN2IPZdN1hdNTgHeQx6Q.jpg","genres":["Документальный","Аниме"],"overview":"In the year 1930, vampires have infiltrated Tokyo to feast upon its unsuspecting citizens. As the number of victims continues to rise, the city's authorities decide to hire the Jaegers—a strange, diverse group of individuals tasked by the V Shipping Company to hunt down vampires around the world. Carrying musical instrument cases to disguise their identity, the Jaegers battle the vampires with the same mercilessness demonstrated by their foes. Yuliy, the Jaeger's most skilled warrior, is the sole survivor of a vampire raid on his home village. Using the strength granted by his werewolf blood, he works with his team to assist Tokyo's law enforcement with the city's vampire problem. Though under the pretense of helping the police, the Jaegers are actually fighting the vampires over the mystical Ark of Sirius. With its power to change the fate of the world, Yuliy and his friends must locate the artifact before the vampires can use it to achieve their destructive goals. [Written by MAL Rewrite]","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1550678","ru":"Frankenstein","en":"Frankenstein","year":"2025","type":"Аниме","rating":10.0,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1tXvitKNh3nf58hXwDiaRu5IT4G.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7vAfULtBig2XkCHL61JsLhwcgGB.jpg","genres":["Фэнтези","Фантастика","Триллер","Аниме"],"overview":"1857 год. Команда застрявшего в северных льдах датского корабля спасает раненого мужчину от похожего на человека чудовища, которое невозможно убить. Тот рассказывает капитану свою историю: его зовут Виктор Франкенштейн, он сын знаменитого врача, и с самого детства вынашивал идею оживить мёртвую плоть. У него появилась возможность проводить в этой сфере всевозможные эксперименты, когда дядя невесты младшего брата Виктора предложил ему неограниченное финансирование.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"1369362","ru":"Amnesia","en":"Amnesia","year":"2024","type":"Аниме","rating":10.0,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/e7aAfFaS9QwSmZJ3gBdgdb0lxhS.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iEwLB9HqpmokEN0PXk0B8LNInvo.jpg","genres":["Комедия","Аниме"],"overview":"Animate Tokuten for purchasing all 6 volumes of TV Anime Series. The contents of the OVA are from the Drama CDs.","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"118974","ru":"Puffins","en":"Puffins","year":"2020","type":"Аниме","rating":10.0,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zloHr2ZknoiFTy10Sms9duLd7dG.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7sMBtuqqd39bcQPT7B9bEWvm6M9.jpg","genres":["Мультфильм","Семейный","Детский","Комедия","Аниме"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"278708","ru":"斑马百科2025","en":"斑马百科2025","year":"2025","type":"Аниме","rating":10.0,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/beKo8JetZadXwS4SgmYKeMtUX1a.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zlrfE67B0E6gmnMO0cTskItO4It.jpg","genres":["Мультфильм","Детский","Аниме"],"overview":"","source":"tmdb","episodes":"","studio":"","country":"","ageRating":""},{"id":"93596","ru":"ゼノンザード THE ANIMATION","en":"ゼノンザード THE ANIMATION","year":"2020","type":"Аниме","rating":10.0,"votes":2,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/t6Kdmfc8Zluot9oyt38AYf2bmIr.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cg23sWBEsmupDie2klPdGWTqIrP.jpg","genres":["Мультфильм","Боевик","Фантастика","Аниме"],"overview":"